	(text "VOUT = 0.8 V x (1 + 52.3k / 10k) = 4.98 V (4.88-5.08 V over the V_FB tolerance); RT to GND sets 1.2 MHz.\nL201 4.7 uH (I_sat 3.2 A): ripple 0.39 A at 9 V, 0.53 A at 12.6 V.  C_OUT 2 x 22 uF + 100 nF (~22 uF at 5 V).\nEN UVLO R201 / R202: start 9.11 V, stop 8.47 V (~2.8 V per cell protects the pack).  C205 47 nF: t_SS 6.8 ms.\nLayout: C203 at the VIN pin; minimal BUCK_SW copper, nothing under it on L3/L4; FB divider at the IC,\nsensing at the output caps (docs/power-map.md)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 114.3 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "10fc46e3-230b-53bb-8527-853443a8c773")
	)
	(text "3V3 LDO (TLV75533P)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 240.03 24.13 0)
		(effects
